[1m[38;5;231mWhich task changes should generate a notification in v1?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Status changed
  [38;5;246mCompleted, reopened, moved between states. The highest-signal event; almost always worth a notification.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Assignment changed
  [38;5;246mTask assigned to or unassigned from someone. Directly changes who owes what; also creates an implicit subscription.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Due date changed
  [38;5;246mAdded, moved, or removed. Changes urgency and scheduling; high signal, low volume.[39m
[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m4.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m [38;5;153mComment added[39m
  [38;5;246mSomeone said something. High signal for discussion, and the main reason people come back to a task.[39m
  [38;5;246m5. [39m[ ] [38;5;246mType something[39m
